		<RichText x="738" y="223" width="423" height="85" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">战斗开始时，翼骏师进入「唤雷」形态，并展开<span textDecoration="underline">幻雷护罩</span><span>，该状态持续直至护罩被破坏。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="447" width="438" height="114" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">距离较远时，翼骏狮升空，衔着雷剑向玩家突击，造成<span color="#ffacff">100%</span><span>伤害，若玩家距离较近，则还会追加一段翻尾攻击，造成</span><span color="#ffacff">60%</span><span>伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="671" width="439" height="114" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">翼骏狮将雷剑插入地面，并对其施加强风，使其产生冲击地波，每次造成<span color="#ffacff">60%</span><span>伤害，一共会形成4道冲击波。可受</span><span color="#bfdfff">「星烁反应」</span><span>影响。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="1410" y="223" width="423" height="85" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">翼骏狮使用左右双爪先后进行攻击，均造成<span color="#7fffd7">30%</span><span>伤害，若玩家距离较近，则还会追加一段翻尾攻击，造成</span><span color="#ffacff">60%</span><span>伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="895" width="398" height="85" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">翼骏狮利用双头施放双属性高能激光束，接触造成对应元素的<span color="#ffff99">50%,25%,<br/>10%,5%</span><span>伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="1410" y="671" width="439" height="114" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">瘫痪恢复后，翼骏狮进入「驱风」形态，绕场地盘旋大半圈，并在途径的位置留下共8枚烈风弹。烈风弹依次朝玩家飞去，造成<span color="#7fffd7">50%,25%,10%,5%</span><span>伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="739" y="1119" width="423" height="85" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">翼骏狮短暂蓄力，突然朝玩家冲来并着陆，造成<span color="#7fffd7">60%</span><span>伤害，准备重新进入「唤雷」形态。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="1410" y="447" width="437" height="85" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">距离较远时，翼骏狮吐出5枚雳珠，并加以强化，朝着玩家飞去，造成<span color="#ffacff">40%,20%,<br/>10%,4%</span><span>伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
