		<RichText x="899" y="62" fontFamily="造字工房悦圆 G0v1 常规体" fontSize="24" fontStyle="normal" fontWeight="normal" color="#8d29b4" width="207" height="28" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="1">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="造字工房悦圆 G0v1 常规体" fontSize="24" color="#8d29b4">制图@Csxylic米游社</p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="66" y="1128" width="437" height="78" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.7490196078431373">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="16" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">幻雷护罩：<span color="#ffacff">12雷</span><span>盾，击破可使其瘫痪12s；受到「星烁反应」影响</span><span color="#ffacff">-4雷</span><span>。第</span><span color="#ffdfbf">2</span><span>/</span><span color="#ffdfbf">3</span><span>次及之后展开护罩的厚度为</span><span color="#ffacff">8</span><span>/</span><span color="#ffacff">6雷</span><span>。<br/>风球：可被</span><span color="#ff9999">火</span><span>/</span><span color="#7fbfff">水</span><span>/</span><span color="#ffacff">雷</span><span>/</span><span color="#99ffff">冰</span><span>攻击击毁，翼骏狮吸收不到足够的风球会瘫痪，持续16s。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
