		<RichText x="1410" y="895" width="441" height="114" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">翼骏狮蜷缩，在场地召唤5枚<span textDecoration="underline">风球</span><span>，5s后尝试吸收它们。若10s内吸收了3枚风球，则施放气爆，造成</span><span color="#7fffd7">30%</span><span>伤害，否则施放失败。可受</span><span color="#bfdfff">「星烁反应」</span><span>影响。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<BitmapImage source="@Embed('/嵌合翼骏狮.assets/Image_42.png')" x="1391" y="810">
