		</BitmapImage>
		<RichText x="1410" y="1119" width="424" height="114" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">「威淬万钧」：中断技能，并使其护罩<span color="#ffdfbf">-4</span><span>单位；「烈惊千朽」：无法吸收风球，并失去</span><span color="#ffdfbf">15%</span><span>生命值</span><span color="#ffdfbf">(仅大世界)</span><span>。两者均会掉落</span><span color="#ffdfbf">6枚</span><span>对应元素微粒。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
